{"zh": "<div><section class=\"ch\" id=\"ch12\"><p class=\"lead rv\"><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Turn ambiguous customer requests into measurable AI deliveries using thin slices, explicit acceptance and reliable handoffs.\" data-i18n-zh=\"从模糊需求出发，通过可验证的最小闭环、验收指标与可靠交接，交付能持续运行的 AI 系统。\">从模糊需求出发，通过可验证的最小闭环、验收指标与可靠交接，交付能持续运行的 AI 系统。</span></p><h2 class=\"sub\" id=\"fde-framework\"><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"12.1 FDE delivery chain: from ambiguous ask to operating outcome\" data-i18n-zh=\"12.1 FDE 的完整交付链：问题到运行结果\">12.1 FDE 的完整交付链：问题到运行结果</span></h2>\n<p class=\"rv\"><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Delivery is not a model answering one polished example. The customer workflow, data access, acceptance conditions, safe degradation and handoff belong to one decision chain.\" data-i18n-zh=\"技术交付不是“模型能回答一个示例”。应把真实工作流、数据权限、业务验收、安全降级和交接放进同一个决策链。\">技术交付不是“模型能回答一个示例”。应把真实工作流、数据权限、业务验收、安全降级和交接放进同一个决策链。</span></p>\n<pre aria-label=\"代码示例\" class=\"rv\" role=\"region\" tabindex=\"0\"><code>Ambiguous request\n → discover constraints and baseline\n → define success + non-goals\n → walking skeleton\n → evaluated thin slice\n → shadow / canary release\n → operating owner + handoff</code></pre>\n<h2 class=\"sub\" id=\"discovery\"><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"12.2 Requirements discovery: ask architecture-changing questions\" data-i18n-zh=\"12.2 Requirements Discovery：问能改变架构的问题\">12.2 Requirements Discovery：问能改变架构的问题</span></h2>\n<div class=\"tsc rv\"><div aria-label=\"可横向滚动的对比表\" class=\"tw\" role=\"region\" tabindex=\"0\"><table><thead><tr><th scope=\"col\"><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Lens\" data-i18n-zh=\"维度\">维度</span></th><th scope=\"col\"><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Customer question\" data-i18n-zh=\"客户问题\">客户问题</span></th><th scope=\"col\"><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Determines\" data-i18n-zh=\"决定什么\">决定什么</span></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Outcome\" data-i18n-zh=\"结果\">结果</span></td><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Which step improves vs what baseline?\" data-i18n-zh=\"改善谁的哪一步？对比哪个 baseline？\">改善谁的哪一步？对比哪个 baseline？</span></td><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Success metric\" data-i18n-zh=\"成功指标\">成功指标</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Access\" data-i18n-zh=\"权限\">权限</span></td><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Which data, who may read or write?\" data-i18n-zh=\"什么数据？谁能读写？\">什么数据？谁能读写？</span></td><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Identity / RLS / VPC\" data-i18n-zh=\"身份 / RLS / VPC\">身份 / RLS / VPC</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Failure\" data-i18n-zh=\"失败\">失败</span></td><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Which is worse: wrong answer or abstention?\" data-i18n-zh=\"答错与拒答哪个损失更大？\">答错与拒答哪个损失更大？</span></td><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"HITL / gate\" data-i18n-zh=\"HITL / gate\">HITL / gate</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Operations\" data-i18n-zh=\"运行\">运行</span></td><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"How fast, concurrent, and who operates it?\" data-i18n-zh=\"多快、多少并发、谁维护？\">多快、多少并发、谁维护？</span></td><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"SLO / cost / owner\" data-i18n-zh=\"SLO / cost / owner\">SLO / cost / owner</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>\n<p class=\"rv\"><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"For each assumption log evidence, owner, validation action and decision date; a meeting remark is not automatically a confirmed requirement.\" data-i18n-zh=\"记录假设时注明证据、owner、验证动作和决策时间；会议里说过不代表已确认为需求。\">记录假设时注明证据、owner、验证动作和决策时间；会议里说过不代表已确认为需求。</span></p>\n<h2 class=\"sub\" id=\"walking-skeleton\"><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"12.3 Walking skeleton: prove the thinnest real end-to-end slice\" data-i18n-zh=\"12.3 Walking Skeleton：优先跑通最薄的真实闭环\">12.3 Walking Skeleton：优先跑通最薄的真实闭环</span></h2>\n<pre aria-label=\"代码示例\" class=\"rv\" role=\"region\" tabindex=\"0\"><code>ONE customer identity\n → ONE authorized data source\n → ONE realistic task\n → ONE production-shaped deployment path\n → ONE trace and acceptance assertion</code></pre>\n<p class=\"rv\"><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"A polished notebook cannot prove integration. Cross network, identity, ingestion, execution, observability and rollback boundaries early; add multi-agent orchestration only when evidence requires it.\" data-i18n-zh=\"一份完美 Notebook 不证明集成成功。最小闭环必须尽早跨越网络、认证、数据获取、执行、可观测和回滚边界；再决定是否需要多 Agent。\">一份完美 Notebook 不证明集成成功。最小闭环必须尽早跨越网络、认证、数据获取、执行、可观测和回滚边界；再决定是否需要多 Agent。</span></p>\n<h2 class=\"sub\" id=\"scope-contract\"><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"12.4 Scope: write in/out boundaries beside acceptance\" data-i18n-zh=\"12.4 Scope：把 In / Out 与验收写在同一页\">12.4 Scope：把 In / Out 与验收写在同一页</span></h2>\n<div class=\"tsc rv\"><div aria-label=\"可横向滚动的对比表\" class=\"tw\" role=\"region\" tabindex=\"0\"><table><thead><tr><th scope=\"col\"><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Item\" data-i18n-zh=\"项目\">项目</span></th><th scope=\"col\"><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"In scope\" data-i18n-zh=\"In scope\">In scope</span></th><th scope=\"col\"><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Out of scope\" data-i18n-zh=\"Out of scope\">Out of scope</span></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Users\" data-i18n-zh=\"用户\">用户</span></td><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Named authorized support team\" data-i18n-zh=\"指定的已授权支持团队\">指定的已授权支持团队</span></td><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Every team in the company\" data-i18n-zh=\"公司所有团队\">公司所有团队</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Workflow\" data-i18n-zh=\"工作流\">工作流</span></td><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Explain one order anomaly with evidence\" data-i18n-zh=\"解释一类订单异常并提供证据\">解释一类订单异常并提供证据</span></td><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Edit all orders or auto-refund\" data-i18n-zh=\"修改全部订单及自动退款\">修改全部订单及自动退款</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Evaluation\" data-i18n-zh=\"评估\">评估</span></td><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Labeled evals, access tests, latency budget\" data-i18n-zh=\"标注集、权限测试、延迟预算\">标注集、权限测试、延迟预算</span></td><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"A demo that merely looks good\" data-i18n-zh=\"“展示时看起来不错”\">“展示时看起来不错”</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>\n<h2 class=\"sub\" id=\"acceptance\"><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"12.5 Acceptance contract: correctness, latency, cost and risk\" data-i18n-zh=\"12.5 Acceptance Contract：把正确、时延、成本、风险分开\">12.5 Acceptance Contract：把正确、时延、成本、风险分开</span></h2>\n<div class=\"tsc rv\"><div aria-label=\"可横向滚动的对比表\" class=\"tw\" role=\"region\" tabindex=\"0\"><table><thead><tr><th scope=\"col\"><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Dimension\" data-i18n-zh=\"维度\">维度</span></th><th scope=\"col\"><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Example metric\" data-i18n-zh=\"指标示例\">指标示例</span></th><th scope=\"col\"><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Failure caught\" data-i18n-zh=\"对应失败\">对应失败</span></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Business\" data-i18n-zh=\"业务\">业务</span></td><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Time saved per verified task\" data-i18n-zh=\"每个已核验任务节省的人工时间\">每个已核验任务节省的人工时间</span></td><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"No real customer value\" data-i18n-zh=\"没有实际价值\">没有实际价值</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Quality\" data-i18n-zh=\"质量\">质量</span></td><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Correct/grounded rate on held-out tasks\" data-i18n-zh=\"真实样本 correct/grounded rate\">真实样本 correct/grounded rate</span></td><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Demo-only overfitting\" data-i18n-zh=\"只在演示样本好看\">只在演示样本好看</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Security\" data-i18n-zh=\"安全\">安全</span></td><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Unauthorized-read / tool-denial tests\" data-i18n-zh=\"越权读取和工具拒绝测试\">越权读取和工具拒绝测试</span></td><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Verbal safety promise\" data-i18n-zh=\"模型口头保证安全\">模型口头保证安全</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Reliability\" data-i18n-zh=\"可靠性\">可靠性</span></td><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"p95 latency, timeout, rollback\" data-i18n-zh=\"p95 latency、timeout、rollback\">p95 latency、timeout、rollback</span></td><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Averages hide tail failures\" data-i18n-zh=\"平均数掩盖尾部故障\">平均数掩盖尾部故障</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Economics\" data-i18n-zh=\"经济性\">经济性</span></td><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Cost per successful approved task\" data-i18n-zh=\"Cost per successful approved task\">Cost per successful approved task</span></td><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Token cost mistaken for value\" data-i18n-zh=\"仅优化每 Token 成本\">仅优化每 Token 成本</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>\n<h2 class=\"sub\" id=\"tradeoffs\"><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"12.6 Explain trade-offs: decision, benefit, risk, evidence\" data-i18n-zh=\"12.6 向非工程师解释取舍：决策 / 收益 / 风险 / 证据\">12.6 向非工程师解释取舍：决策 / 收益 / 风险 / 证据</span></h2>\n<p class=\"rv\"><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Example: start invoice-ID lookup with permission-filtered Exact/BM25 for auditability, then add dense retrieval if labeled tests show insufficient paraphrase recall. This is not a universal claim that BM25 always beats vectors.\" data-i18n-zh=\"示例：发票精确查询优先试用 permission-filtered Exact/BM25 路径，因为来源与权限容易审计；如果评估发现同义改写召回不足，再加入 Dense 检索。不是预设 BM25 永远优于向量检索。\">示例：发票精确查询优先试用 permission-filtered Exact/BM25 路径，因为来源与权限容易审计；如果评估发现同义改写召回不足，再加入 Dense 检索。不是预设 BM25 永远优于向量检索。</span></p>\n<h2 class=\"sub\" id=\"demo-failure\"><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"12.7 Failed live demos: transparent recovery beats performance\" data-i18n-zh=\"12.7 Live Demo 故障：透明恢复优于掩饰\">12.7 Live Demo 故障：透明恢复优于掩饰</span></h2>\n<div class=\"tsc rv\"><div aria-label=\"可横向滚动的对比表\" class=\"tw\" role=\"region\" tabindex=\"0\"><table><thead><tr><th scope=\"col\"><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Moment\" data-i18n-zh=\"时刻\">时刻</span></th><th scope=\"col\"><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Action\" data-i18n-zh=\"行动\">行动</span></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Preflight\" data-i18n-zh=\"演示前\">演示前</span></td><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Check identity, service health, freshness, and known-good request\" data-i18n-zh=\"核对权限、实时服务、数据刷新时间和已知成功请求\">核对权限、实时服务、数据刷新时间和已知成功请求</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Failure\" data-i18n-zh=\"发生故障\">发生故障</span></td><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Explain the failed boundary and impact; capture the trace\" data-i18n-zh=\"明确失败步骤与客户影响，记录 trace\">明确失败步骤与客户影响，记录 trace</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Fallback\" data-i18n-zh=\"降级\">降级</span></td><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Mark prerecorded or simulated paths; never imply live success\" data-i18n-zh=\"回放必须标记为录制/样例，不伪称实时成功\">回放必须标记为录制/样例，不伪称实时成功</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Follow-up\" data-i18n-zh=\"后续\">后续</span></td><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Provide owner, reproduction, and next decision\" data-i18n-zh=\"给出 owner、复现步骤和交付决策\">给出 owner、复现步骤和交付决策</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>\n<h2 class=\"sub\" id=\"handoff\"><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"12.8 Handoff: reliable operation without the original FDE\" data-i18n-zh=\"12.8 Handoff：离开后系统仍能被可靠运行\">12.8 Handoff：离开后系统仍能被可靠运行</span></h2>\n<p class=\"rv\"><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"A handoff needs data contracts, tenant policies, versioned evals, a dashboard, SLO, incident runbook, cost budget, release/rollback instructions, and an on-call owner.\" data-i18n-zh=\"交接最小集包含：数据契约、租户权限、版本化 Eval Suite、仪表盘、SLO、Incident Runbook、成本预算、发布/回滚说明、明确的值班与升级负责人。\">交接最小集包含：数据契约、租户权限、版本化 Eval Suite、仪表盘、SLO、Incident Runbook、成本预算、发布/回滚说明、明确的值班与升级负责人。</span></p>\n<h2 class=\"sub\" id=\"fde-case\"><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"12.9 Case study: emergency-response delay\" data-i18n-zh=\"12.9 场景演练：紧急服务响应时间\">12.9 场景演练：紧急服务响应时间</span></h2>\n<p class=\"rv\"><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"A city wants faster emergency response. Measure call intake, human triage, location, dispatch, travel and reporting separately. Keep high-stakes dispatch authority with qualified humans. A first slice may be audited assistive transcription, not autonomous dispatch.\" data-i18n-zh=\"客户希望降低急救响应时间。先拆成接线、人工分诊、定位、派单、行车和记录延迟，确认决定权必须在合格的人类调度员手中。第一阶段可以是经过审核的辅助转录/信息整理，而非自动调度。\">客户希望降低急救响应时间。先拆成接线、人工分诊、定位、派单、行车和记录延迟，确认决定权必须在合格的人类调度员手中。第一阶段可以是经过审核的辅助转录/信息整理，而非自动调度。</span></p>\n<p class=\"rv\"><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"If travel dominates the delay, an LLM intake agent is likely the wrong investment. A strong FDE tests that hypothesis rather than forcing an AI solution.\" data-i18n-zh=\"若最大的瓶颈是路况和行车时间，部署 LLM 文本助手很可能没有意义。强 FDE 会证明或否定这个假设，而不是强行套 AI 架构。\">若最大的瓶颈是路况和行车时间，部署 LLM 文本助手很可能没有意义。强 FDE 会证明或否定这个假设，而不是强行套 AI 架构。</span></p>\n<h2 class=\"sub\" id=\"fde-crosswalk\"><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"12.10 Mapping 167 FDE concepts to 12 Atlas chapters\" data-i18n-zh=\"12.10 FDE 167 概念 × Handbook 12 章：如何分工\">12.10 FDE 167 概念 × Handbook 12 章：如何分工</span></h2>\n<div class=\"tsc rv\"><div aria-label=\"可横向滚动的对比表\" class=\"tw\" role=\"region\" tabindex=\"0\"><table><thead><tr><th scope=\"col\"><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Original FDE track\" data-i18n-zh=\"FDE 原始 Track\">FDE 原始 Track</span></th><th scope=\"col\"><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Atlas owner\" data-i18n-zh=\"Handbook 责任章节\">Handbook 责任章节</span></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Foundations of LLMs &amp; GenAI\" data-i18n-zh=\"Foundations of LLMs &amp; GenAI\">Foundations of LLMs &amp; GenAI</span></td><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"01 models + 10 serving\" data-i18n-zh=\"01 模型 + 10 Serving\">01 模型 + 10 Serving</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Retrieval &amp; Agents\" data-i18n-zh=\"Retrieval &amp; Agents\">Retrieval &amp; Agents</span></td><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"02–08; evals 09, Text-to-SQL 11\" data-i18n-zh=\"02–08；评价归 09，Text-to-SQL 归 11\">02–08；评价归 09，Text-to-SQL 归 11</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Evaluation &amp; ML Foundations\" data-i18n-zh=\"Evaluation &amp; ML Foundations\">Evaluation &amp; ML Foundations</span></td><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"01 foundations + 09 evals\" data-i18n-zh=\"01 基础 + 09 Eval\">01 基础 + 09 Eval</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"System Design for AI in Production\" data-i18n-zh=\"System Design for AI in Production\">System Design for AI in Production</span></td><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"10 system + 12 delivery\" data-i18n-zh=\"10 系统 + 12 交付\">10 系统 + 12 交付</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"MLOps &amp; Lifecycle\" data-i18n-zh=\"MLOps &amp; Lifecycle\">MLOps &amp; Lifecycle</span></td><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"09/10; feature stores 11\" data-i18n-zh=\"09/10；Feature Store 归 11\">09/10；Feature Store 归 11</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"ML Infrastructure &amp; Serving\" data-i18n-zh=\"ML Infrastructure &amp; Serving\">ML Infrastructure &amp; Serving</span></td><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"10; distillation 01\" data-i18n-zh=\"10；蒸馏归 01\">10；蒸馏归 01</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Data &amp; SQL Engineering\" data-i18n-zh=\"Data &amp; SQL Engineering\">Data &amp; SQL Engineering</span></td><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"11 data and SQL\" data-i18n-zh=\"11 数据与 SQL\">11 数据与 SQL</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"AI Security, Privacy &amp; Governance\" data-i18n-zh=\"AI Security, Privacy &amp; Governance\">AI Security, Privacy &amp; Governance</span></td><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"10 security + 01 some foundations\" data-i18n-zh=\"10 安全 + 01 部分基础\">10 安全 + 01 部分基础</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Coding &amp; Engineering Craft\" data-i18n-zh=\"Coding &amp; Engineering Craft\">Coding &amp; Engineering Craft</span></td><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"01/02/08/10/11 by responsibility\" data-i18n-zh=\"01/02/08/10/11 按工程边界\">01/02/08/10/11 按工程边界</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"The Customer-Facing Craft\" data-i18n-zh=\"The Customer-Facing Craft\">The Customer-Facing Craft</span></td><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"12 FDE delivery\" data-i18n-zh=\"12 FDE 客户交付\">12 FDE 客户交付</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>\n<p class=\"rv\"><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"This map assigns knowledge ownership; it does not claim all 167 concepts are taught in depth. The full item-level index is in handbook/references/fde-2026-concept-crosswalk.md.\" data-i18n-zh=\"此表只表示知识归属，不代表 167 个概念都已充分讲解。完整版 167 项索引位于仓库 handbook/references/fde-2026-concept-crosswalk.md。\">此表只表示知识归属，不代表 167 个概念都已充分讲解。完整版 167 项索引位于仓库 handbook/references/fde-2026-concept-crosswalk.md。</span></p>\n<p class=\"rv\"><a href=\"https://www.fdeinterviews.com/concepts\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Source: FDE curriculum topics (not copied course text) ↗</a></p></section></div>", "en": "<div><section class=\"ch\" id=\"ch12\"><p class=\"lead rv\"><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Turn ambiguous customer requests into measurable AI deliveries using thin slices, explicit acceptance and reliable handoffs.\" data-i18n-zh=\"从模糊需求出发，通过可验证的最小闭环、验收指标与可靠交接，交付能持续运行的 AI 系统。\">Turn ambiguous customer requests into measurable AI deliveries using thin slices, explicit acceptance and reliable handoffs.</span></p><h2 class=\"sub\" id=\"fde-framework\"><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"12.1 FDE delivery chain: from ambiguous ask to operating outcome\" data-i18n-zh=\"12.1 FDE 的完整交付链：问题到运行结果\">12.1 FDE delivery chain: from ambiguous ask to operating outcome</span></h2>\n<p class=\"rv\"><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Delivery is not a model answering one polished example. The customer workflow, data access, acceptance conditions, safe degradation and handoff belong to one decision chain.\" data-i18n-zh=\"技术交付不是“模型能回答一个示例”。应把真实工作流、数据权限、业务验收、安全降级和交接放进同一个决策链。\">Delivery is not a model answering one polished example. The customer workflow, data access, acceptance conditions, safe degradation and handoff belong to one decision chain.</span></p>\n<pre aria-label=\"Code example\" class=\"rv\" role=\"region\" tabindex=\"0\"><code>Ambiguous request\n → discover constraints and baseline\n → define success + non-goals\n → walking skeleton\n → evaluated thin slice\n → shadow / canary release\n → operating owner + handoff</code></pre>\n<h2 class=\"sub\" id=\"discovery\"><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"12.2 Requirements discovery: ask architecture-changing questions\" data-i18n-zh=\"12.2 Requirements Discovery：问能改变架构的问题\">12.2 Requirements discovery: ask architecture-changing questions</span></h2>\n<div class=\"tsc rv\"><div aria-label=\"Scrollable comparison table\" class=\"tw\" role=\"region\" tabindex=\"0\"><table><thead><tr><th scope=\"col\"><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Lens\" data-i18n-zh=\"维度\">Lens</span></th><th scope=\"col\"><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Customer question\" data-i18n-zh=\"客户问题\">Customer question</span></th><th scope=\"col\"><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Determines\" data-i18n-zh=\"决定什么\">Determines</span></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Outcome\" data-i18n-zh=\"结果\">Outcome</span></td><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Which step improves vs what baseline?\" data-i18n-zh=\"改善谁的哪一步？对比哪个 baseline？\">Which step improves vs what baseline?</span></td><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Success metric\" data-i18n-zh=\"成功指标\">Success metric</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Access\" data-i18n-zh=\"权限\">Access</span></td><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Which data, who may read or write?\" data-i18n-zh=\"什么数据？谁能读写？\">Which data, who may read or write?</span></td><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Identity / RLS / VPC\" data-i18n-zh=\"身份 / RLS / VPC\">Identity / RLS / VPC</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Failure\" data-i18n-zh=\"失败\">Failure</span></td><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Which is worse: wrong answer or abstention?\" data-i18n-zh=\"答错与拒答哪个损失更大？\">Which is worse: wrong answer or abstention?</span></td><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"HITL / gate\" data-i18n-zh=\"HITL / gate\">HITL / gate</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Operations\" data-i18n-zh=\"运行\">Operations</span></td><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"How fast, concurrent, and who operates it?\" data-i18n-zh=\"多快、多少并发、谁维护？\">How fast, concurrent, and who operates it?</span></td><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"SLO / cost / owner\" data-i18n-zh=\"SLO / cost / owner\">SLO / cost / owner</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>\n<p class=\"rv\"><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"For each assumption log evidence, owner, validation action and decision date; a meeting remark is not automatically a confirmed requirement.\" data-i18n-zh=\"记录假设时注明证据、owner、验证动作和决策时间；会议里说过不代表已确认为需求。\">For each assumption log evidence, owner, validation action and decision date; a meeting remark is not automatically a confirmed requirement.</span></p>\n<h2 class=\"sub\" id=\"walking-skeleton\"><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"12.3 Walking skeleton: prove the thinnest real end-to-end slice\" data-i18n-zh=\"12.3 Walking Skeleton：优先跑通最薄的真实闭环\">12.3 Walking skeleton: prove the thinnest real end-to-end slice</span></h2>\n<pre aria-label=\"Code example\" class=\"rv\" role=\"region\" tabindex=\"0\"><code>ONE customer identity\n → ONE authorized data source\n → ONE realistic task\n → ONE production-shaped deployment path\n → ONE trace and acceptance assertion</code></pre>\n<p class=\"rv\"><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"A polished notebook cannot prove integration. Cross network, identity, ingestion, execution, observability and rollback boundaries early; add multi-agent orchestration only when evidence requires it.\" data-i18n-zh=\"一份完美 Notebook 不证明集成成功。最小闭环必须尽早跨越网络、认证、数据获取、执行、可观测和回滚边界；再决定是否需要多 Agent。\">A polished notebook cannot prove integration. Cross network, identity, ingestion, execution, observability and rollback boundaries early; add multi-agent orchestration only when evidence requires it.</span></p>\n<h2 class=\"sub\" id=\"scope-contract\"><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"12.4 Scope: write in/out boundaries beside acceptance\" data-i18n-zh=\"12.4 Scope：把 In / Out 与验收写在同一页\">12.4 Scope: write in/out boundaries beside acceptance</span></h2>\n<div class=\"tsc rv\"><div aria-label=\"Scrollable comparison table\" class=\"tw\" role=\"region\" tabindex=\"0\"><table><thead><tr><th scope=\"col\"><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Item\" data-i18n-zh=\"项目\">Item</span></th><th scope=\"col\"><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"In scope\" data-i18n-zh=\"In scope\">In scope</span></th><th scope=\"col\"><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Out of scope\" data-i18n-zh=\"Out of scope\">Out of scope</span></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Users\" data-i18n-zh=\"用户\">Users</span></td><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Named authorized support team\" data-i18n-zh=\"指定的已授权支持团队\">Named authorized support team</span></td><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Every team in the company\" data-i18n-zh=\"公司所有团队\">Every team in the company</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Workflow\" data-i18n-zh=\"工作流\">Workflow</span></td><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Explain one order anomaly with evidence\" data-i18n-zh=\"解释一类订单异常并提供证据\">Explain one order anomaly with evidence</span></td><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Edit all orders or auto-refund\" data-i18n-zh=\"修改全部订单及自动退款\">Edit all orders or auto-refund</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Evaluation\" data-i18n-zh=\"评估\">Evaluation</span></td><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Labeled evals, access tests, latency budget\" data-i18n-zh=\"标注集、权限测试、延迟预算\">Labeled evals, access tests, latency budget</span></td><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"A demo that merely looks good\" data-i18n-zh=\"“展示时看起来不错”\">A demo that merely looks good</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>\n<h2 class=\"sub\" id=\"acceptance\"><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"12.5 Acceptance contract: correctness, latency, cost and risk\" data-i18n-zh=\"12.5 Acceptance Contract：把正确、时延、成本、风险分开\">12.5 Acceptance contract: correctness, latency, cost and risk</span></h2>\n<div class=\"tsc rv\"><div aria-label=\"Scrollable comparison table\" class=\"tw\" role=\"region\" tabindex=\"0\"><table><thead><tr><th scope=\"col\"><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Dimension\" data-i18n-zh=\"维度\">Dimension</span></th><th scope=\"col\"><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Example metric\" data-i18n-zh=\"指标示例\">Example metric</span></th><th scope=\"col\"><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Failure caught\" data-i18n-zh=\"对应失败\">Failure caught</span></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Business\" data-i18n-zh=\"业务\">Business</span></td><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Time saved per verified task\" data-i18n-zh=\"每个已核验任务节省的人工时间\">Time saved per verified task</span></td><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"No real customer value\" data-i18n-zh=\"没有实际价值\">No real customer value</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Quality\" data-i18n-zh=\"质量\">Quality</span></td><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Correct/grounded rate on held-out tasks\" data-i18n-zh=\"真实样本 correct/grounded rate\">Correct/grounded rate on held-out tasks</span></td><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Demo-only overfitting\" data-i18n-zh=\"只在演示样本好看\">Demo-only overfitting</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Security\" data-i18n-zh=\"安全\">Security</span></td><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Unauthorized-read / tool-denial tests\" data-i18n-zh=\"越权读取和工具拒绝测试\">Unauthorized-read / tool-denial tests</span></td><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Verbal safety promise\" data-i18n-zh=\"模型口头保证安全\">Verbal safety promise</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Reliability\" data-i18n-zh=\"可靠性\">Reliability</span></td><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"p95 latency, timeout, rollback\" data-i18n-zh=\"p95 latency、timeout、rollback\">p95 latency, timeout, rollback</span></td><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Averages hide tail failures\" data-i18n-zh=\"平均数掩盖尾部故障\">Averages hide tail failures</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Economics\" data-i18n-zh=\"经济性\">Economics</span></td><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Cost per successful approved task\" data-i18n-zh=\"Cost per successful approved task\">Cost per successful approved task</span></td><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Token cost mistaken for value\" data-i18n-zh=\"仅优化每 Token 成本\">Token cost mistaken for value</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>\n<h2 class=\"sub\" id=\"tradeoffs\"><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"12.6 Explain trade-offs: decision, benefit, risk, evidence\" data-i18n-zh=\"12.6 向非工程师解释取舍：决策 / 收益 / 风险 / 证据\">12.6 Explain trade-offs: decision, benefit, risk, evidence</span></h2>\n<p class=\"rv\"><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Example: start invoice-ID lookup with permission-filtered Exact/BM25 for auditability, then add dense retrieval if labeled tests show insufficient paraphrase recall. This is not a universal claim that BM25 always beats vectors.\" data-i18n-zh=\"示例：发票精确查询优先试用 permission-filtered Exact/BM25 路径，因为来源与权限容易审计；如果评估发现同义改写召回不足，再加入 Dense 检索。不是预设 BM25 永远优于向量检索。\">Example: start invoice-ID lookup with permission-filtered Exact/BM25 for auditability, then add dense retrieval if labeled tests show insufficient paraphrase recall. This is not a universal claim that BM25 always beats vectors.</span></p>\n<h2 class=\"sub\" id=\"demo-failure\"><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"12.7 Failed live demos: transparent recovery beats performance\" data-i18n-zh=\"12.7 Live Demo 故障：透明恢复优于掩饰\">12.7 Failed live demos: transparent recovery beats performance</span></h2>\n<div class=\"tsc rv\"><div aria-label=\"Scrollable comparison table\" class=\"tw\" role=\"region\" tabindex=\"0\"><table><thead><tr><th scope=\"col\"><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Moment\" data-i18n-zh=\"时刻\">Moment</span></th><th scope=\"col\"><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Action\" data-i18n-zh=\"行动\">Action</span></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Preflight\" data-i18n-zh=\"演示前\">Preflight</span></td><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Check identity, service health, freshness, and known-good request\" data-i18n-zh=\"核对权限、实时服务、数据刷新时间和已知成功请求\">Check identity, service health, freshness, and known-good request</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Failure\" data-i18n-zh=\"发生故障\">Failure</span></td><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Explain the failed boundary and impact; capture the trace\" data-i18n-zh=\"明确失败步骤与客户影响，记录 trace\">Explain the failed boundary and impact; capture the trace</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Fallback\" data-i18n-zh=\"降级\">Fallback</span></td><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Mark prerecorded or simulated paths; never imply live success\" data-i18n-zh=\"回放必须标记为录制/样例，不伪称实时成功\">Mark prerecorded or simulated paths; never imply live success</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Follow-up\" data-i18n-zh=\"后续\">Follow-up</span></td><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Provide owner, reproduction, and next decision\" data-i18n-zh=\"给出 owner、复现步骤和交付决策\">Provide owner, reproduction, and next decision</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>\n<h2 class=\"sub\" id=\"handoff\"><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"12.8 Handoff: reliable operation without the original FDE\" data-i18n-zh=\"12.8 Handoff：离开后系统仍能被可靠运行\">12.8 Handoff: reliable operation without the original FDE</span></h2>\n<p class=\"rv\"><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"A handoff needs data contracts, tenant policies, versioned evals, a dashboard, SLO, incident runbook, cost budget, release/rollback instructions, and an on-call owner.\" data-i18n-zh=\"交接最小集包含：数据契约、租户权限、版本化 Eval Suite、仪表盘、SLO、Incident Runbook、成本预算、发布/回滚说明、明确的值班与升级负责人。\">A handoff needs data contracts, tenant policies, versioned evals, a dashboard, SLO, incident runbook, cost budget, release/rollback instructions, and an on-call owner.</span></p>\n<h2 class=\"sub\" id=\"fde-case\"><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"12.9 Case study: emergency-response delay\" data-i18n-zh=\"12.9 场景演练：紧急服务响应时间\">12.9 Case study: emergency-response delay</span></h2>\n<p class=\"rv\"><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"A city wants faster emergency response. Measure call intake, human triage, location, dispatch, travel and reporting separately. Keep high-stakes dispatch authority with qualified humans. A first slice may be audited assistive transcription, not autonomous dispatch.\" data-i18n-zh=\"客户希望降低急救响应时间。先拆成接线、人工分诊、定位、派单、行车和记录延迟，确认决定权必须在合格的人类调度员手中。第一阶段可以是经过审核的辅助转录/信息整理，而非自动调度。\">A city wants faster emergency response. Measure call intake, human triage, location, dispatch, travel and reporting separately. Keep high-stakes dispatch authority with qualified humans. A first slice may be audited assistive transcription, not autonomous dispatch.</span></p>\n<p class=\"rv\"><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"If travel dominates the delay, an LLM intake agent is likely the wrong investment. A strong FDE tests that hypothesis rather than forcing an AI solution.\" data-i18n-zh=\"若最大的瓶颈是路况和行车时间，部署 LLM 文本助手很可能没有意义。强 FDE 会证明或否定这个假设，而不是强行套 AI 架构。\">If travel dominates the delay, an LLM intake agent is likely the wrong investment. A strong FDE tests that hypothesis rather than forcing an AI solution.</span></p>\n<h2 class=\"sub\" id=\"fde-crosswalk\"><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"12.10 Mapping 167 FDE concepts to 12 Atlas chapters\" data-i18n-zh=\"12.10 FDE 167 概念 × Handbook 12 章：如何分工\">12.10 Mapping 167 FDE concepts to 12 Atlas chapters</span></h2>\n<div class=\"tsc rv\"><div aria-label=\"Scrollable comparison table\" class=\"tw\" role=\"region\" tabindex=\"0\"><table><thead><tr><th scope=\"col\"><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Original FDE track\" data-i18n-zh=\"FDE 原始 Track\">Original FDE track</span></th><th scope=\"col\"><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Atlas owner\" data-i18n-zh=\"Handbook 责任章节\">Atlas owner</span></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Foundations of LLMs &amp; GenAI\" data-i18n-zh=\"Foundations of LLMs &amp; GenAI\">Foundations of LLMs &amp; GenAI</span></td><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"01 models + 10 serving\" data-i18n-zh=\"01 模型 + 10 Serving\">01 models + 10 serving</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Retrieval &amp; Agents\" data-i18n-zh=\"Retrieval &amp; Agents\">Retrieval &amp; Agents</span></td><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"02–08; evals 09, Text-to-SQL 11\" data-i18n-zh=\"02–08；评价归 09，Text-to-SQL 归 11\">02–08; evals 09, Text-to-SQL 11</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Evaluation &amp; ML Foundations\" data-i18n-zh=\"Evaluation &amp; ML Foundations\">Evaluation &amp; ML Foundations</span></td><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"01 foundations + 09 evals\" data-i18n-zh=\"01 基础 + 09 Eval\">01 foundations + 09 evals</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"System Design for AI in Production\" data-i18n-zh=\"System Design for AI in Production\">System Design for AI in Production</span></td><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"10 system + 12 delivery\" data-i18n-zh=\"10 系统 + 12 交付\">10 system + 12 delivery</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"MLOps &amp; Lifecycle\" data-i18n-zh=\"MLOps &amp; Lifecycle\">MLOps &amp; Lifecycle</span></td><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"09/10; feature stores 11\" data-i18n-zh=\"09/10；Feature Store 归 11\">09/10; feature stores 11</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"ML Infrastructure &amp; Serving\" data-i18n-zh=\"ML Infrastructure &amp; Serving\">ML Infrastructure &amp; Serving</span></td><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"10; distillation 01\" data-i18n-zh=\"10；蒸馏归 01\">10; distillation 01</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Data &amp; SQL Engineering\" data-i18n-zh=\"Data &amp; SQL Engineering\">Data &amp; SQL Engineering</span></td><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"11 data and SQL\" data-i18n-zh=\"11 数据与 SQL\">11 data and SQL</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"AI Security, Privacy &amp; Governance\" data-i18n-zh=\"AI Security, Privacy &amp; Governance\">AI Security, Privacy &amp; Governance</span></td><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"10 security + 01 some foundations\" data-i18n-zh=\"10 安全 + 01 部分基础\">10 security + 01 some foundations</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"Coding &amp; Engineering Craft\" data-i18n-zh=\"Coding &amp; Engineering Craft\">Coding &amp; Engineering Craft</span></td><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"01/02/08/10/11 by responsibility\" data-i18n-zh=\"01/02/08/10/11 按工程边界\">01/02/08/10/11 by responsibility</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"The Customer-Facing Craft\" data-i18n-zh=\"The Customer-Facing Craft\">The Customer-Facing Craft</span></td><td><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"12 FDE delivery\" data-i18n-zh=\"12 FDE 客户交付\">12 FDE delivery</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>\n<p class=\"rv\"><span class=\"i18n-text\" data-i18n-en=\"This map assigns knowledge ownership; it does not claim all 167 concepts are taught in depth. The full item-level index is in handbook/references/fde-2026-concept-crosswalk.md.\" data-i18n-zh=\"此表只表示知识归属，不代表 167 个概念都已充分讲解。完整版 167 项索引位于仓库 handbook/references/fde-2026-concept-crosswalk.md。\">This map assigns knowledge ownership; it does not claim all 167 concepts are taught in depth. The full item-level index is in handbook/references/fde-2026-concept-crosswalk.md.</span></p>\n<p class=\"rv\"><a href=\"https://www.fdeinterviews.com/concepts\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Source: FDE curriculum topics (not copied course text) ↗</a></p></section></div>", "sections": [{"id": "fde-framework", "zh": "12.1 FDE 的完整交付链：问题到运行结果", "en": "12.1 FDE delivery chain: from ambiguous ask to operating outcome"}, {"id": "discovery", "zh": "12.2 Requirements Discovery：问能改变架构的问题", "en": "12.2 Requirements discovery: ask architecture-changing questions"}, {"id": "walking-skeleton", "zh": "12.3 Walking Skeleton：优先跑通最薄的真实闭环", "en": "12.3 Walking skeleton: prove the thinnest real end-to-end slice"}, {"id": "scope-contract", "zh": "12.4 Scope：把 In / Out 与验收写在同一页", "en": "12.4 Scope: write in/out boundaries beside acceptance"}, {"id": "acceptance", "zh": "12.5 Acceptance Contract：把正确、时延、成本、风险分开", "en": "12.5 Acceptance contract: correctness, latency, cost and risk"}, {"id": "tradeoffs", "zh": "12.6 向非工程师解释取舍：决策 / 收益 / 风险 / 证据", "en": "12.6 Explain trade-offs: decision, benefit, risk, evidence"}, {"id": "demo-failure", "zh": "12.7 Live Demo 故障：透明恢复优于掩饰", "en": "12.7 Failed live demos: transparent recovery beats performance"}, {"id": "handoff", "zh": "12.8 Handoff：离开后系统仍能被可靠运行", "en": "12.8 Handoff: reliable operation without the original FDE"}, {"id": "fde-case", "zh": "12.9 场景演练：紧急服务响应时间", "en": "12.9 Case study: emergency-response delay"}, {"id": "fde-crosswalk", "zh": "12.10 FDE 167 概念 × Handbook 12 章：如何分工", "en": "12.10 Mapping 167 FDE concepts to 12 Atlas chapters"}], "supplements": []}